# The bow, measured in the browser through the real engine. 2026-09-10.
#
# The page is a dev-server session, so this file is the only record of these
# numbers, the same reason armrest-0909-browser.log exists.
#
#   npm run dev
#   http://localhost:5173/scripts/avatar/live-preview.html?mikadebug=1
#   ?mikadebug=1 exposes window.__mikaVrm; the readings below are the world
#   position of the leftEye bone, against a baseline averaged over 40 samples
#   at 50ms -- two full seconds, which is longer than a breath. Passes A and B
#   sample at a fixed 720ms after the click (the 1.5s sine envelope peaks at
#   750ms); pass C takes the argmax of the whole trace instead, and says so.
#
# Body: public/avatar/mika-milfy-12.vrm, the milfy look the site serves.
#   VRM metaVersion 0, the same family as pink and base.
#
# AVERAGING THE BASELINE IS LOAD-BEARING. Two passes before these read the peak
# against a single instant of the idle pose and returned OPPOSITE signs on
# consecutive runs: breathing and weight shift move her eyes by the same tens of
# millimetres in Y that the gesture does. Only the Z swing clears that floor.
# Nothing that follows rests on a Y reading.

